                            <h3>Introduction</h3>
                            <p><p align="justify">The Master of Social Work Online (MSWOL) programme provides access to high quality education at the post graduate level to those learners who are interested in advancing their knowledge and skills in Social Work. The programme aims to meet the growing demand for professionally trained social workers in India and abroad. It enables learners to develop required skills in working with individual, families and communities. The program is open to recent graduates seeking opportunities in the government, corporate, and development sectors, as well as to working professionals aiming to enhance their skills and advance their careers.</p></p>
                            <h3>Objective</h3>
